    "omitted": "docs/ and .git/; everything else at that tag is present byte for byte",
    "note": "Vendored rather than pointed at, so this ruler is reproducible by anyone who clones this repository and needs nothing of the machine it was written on. The previous subject was a repository this project did not control, graded against an uncommitted working tree no commit could restore, which left the local-model comparison in the roadmap unattributable. Rebuild the index with `rag-your-code index benchmarks/corpus/flask`."
